title: "Cross-Asset Volatility Spillover Analysis"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-02-08
url: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Analysis-of-Cross-Asset-Volatility-Spillovers"
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - volatility spillovers
  - GARCH
  - DCC
  - Diebold-Yilmaz
  - regime switching
  - machine learning
  - financial econometrics
  - cross-asset analysis
abstract: >
  Analysis of volatility spillovers across equities, bonds, commodities,
  and ESG assets (2005-2025) using GARCH-DCC models, Diebold-Yilmaz
  spillover indices, regime-switching analysis, and machine learning
  forecasting with XGBoost and LightGBM.
